cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this tooling, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "n4o-kg-profile: a YAML-LD metadata profile and build for NFDI4Objects Knowledge Graph collections"
abstract: >-
  Tooling that derives DCAT/VoID metadata, an NFDI4Objects registration record,
  a CIDOC CRM alignment and a browser-side SPARQL page from a single YAML-LD
  file, enforced by SHACL and shipped as a GitHub Action.
authors:
  - given-names: Florian
    family-names: Thiery
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3246-3531
    affiliation: LEIZA / Research Squirrel Engineers Network
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/n4o-rse/n4o-kg-profile
keywords:
  - Linked Open Data
  - NFDI4Objects
  - CIDOC CRM
  - DCAT
  - SHACL
  - YAML-LD
